    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Place similar organs and their developmental or genetic architectures on independently supported phylogenies and test whether similarity arose on separate branches. Multiple independent origins with convergent function support the claim; homology inherited from one ancestor would refute a proposed case.";
